n":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/22","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/22","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/22/labels","id":12070367,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4AuC3f","number":22,"title":"4.5","description":"","creator":{"login":"Sauermann","id":6299227,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYyOTkyMjc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/6299227?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann","html_url":"https://github.com/Sauermann","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"open_issues":3,"closed_issues":3687,"state":"closed","created_at":"2024-12-19T08:51:28Z","updated_at":"2026-09-04T21:48:38Z","due_on":"2025-09-15T00:00:00Z","closed_at":"2025-09-18T17:13:14Z"},"comments":2,"created_at":"2025-03-12T06:04:16Z","updated_at":"2025-05-14T15:33:11Z","closed_at":"2025-05-14T14:49:37Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"MEMBER","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"draft":false,"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/104010","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/104010","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/104010.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/104010.patch","merged_at":"2025-05-14T14:49:37Z"},"body":"In master, Godot has a feature where the main screen tabs may auto-switch depending on the node type being edited.\r\n\r\n* When editing a 2D scene or selecting a 2D node, and the 3D tab is selected, switch to 2D.\r\n* When editing a 3D scene or selecting a 3D node, and the 2D tab is selected, switch to 3D.\r\n* When creating a new 2D or 3D scene, and the tab isn't the script editor (2D/3D/Game/AssetLib/custom), switch.\r\n\r\nSeems simple enough. However, the code currently has the following problems:\r\n\r\n* There is a hard-coded assumption that the script editor is at index 2.\r\n* Instead of using `func _handles` on each plugin, there is hard-coded logic to check for CanvasItem and Node3D.\r\n* The logic does not behave the same when creating scenes as it does when editing scenes or nodes.\r\n* There is some dead code in the script editor for deciding when to switch (it always returns true, but never happens).\r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/4661d7e1-34de-41e3-b18c-b4e21813f897\r\n\r\nThis PR makes the following changes:\r\n\r\n* New function `bool EditorMainScreen::can_auto_switch_screens() const`.\r\n    * This is used both when editing nodes/scenes and when creating new ones, so now the logic is unified.\r\n    * Instead of hard-coding an index for Script, check what position it's at. The new logic is that any tab to the left of Script is considered auto-switch-away-able, and auto-switch-to-able is determined by `func _handles`.\r\n    * For the built-in tabs, this does change behavior in one case: creating a new scene when either the Game or AssetLib tabs are active will keep you on those tabs, just like editing a scene already does.\r\n* Set a human-readable unique name for the EditorMainScreenButtons HBoxContainer.\r\n* Remove the dead `can_take_away_focus` and `can_lose_focus_on_node_selection` functions.\r\n\r\nThis now works correctly for custom node types and main screen tabs placed to the left of Script:\r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/bfb16b61-b4a3-466c-8955-ac2319dbb1cf\r\n\r\nImplements and closes https://github.com/godotengine/godot-proposals/issues/12154\r\n\r\n","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/104010/reactions","total_count":12,"+1":9,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":2,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":1,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/104010/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null}